
macro apagnan 2000
macro skibidi 2002

macro quoicou 2008

preprocessor will replace all instances of apagnan with 2000, skibidi 2002, etc etc



func my_function 3	<- no i immediately discountinue this
arg 2; reads memory at STACKPOINTER + 2 (because sp decreases when stack increases) and puts it into x
lda 0

;read from address, store in X
rex #hw		<- preproc replaces '#hw' with the rom address hw points to

ldd #hw;	loads the rom address 'hw' into D
read;	fetch memory at D and put into X
incd;	increase D
decd;	decrease D


save 1234;	stores in lsb the value in D at 1234
restore 1234; reads value in lsb at 1234 to put into D

save quoicou
restore quoicou

ret


leap 9	//moves the PC 9 bytes later to skip instructions, if flag a == 0


.init





.data
hw:"HelloWorld"
%GRAPHICS	//preproc will replace this with the contents of the GRAPHICS file
